WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.433
Everything on Automations.

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:14.100
Automations. What the system does without anyone pressing a button: follow-ups, reminders and notices. Every message waits in the queue first, where you can stop it.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:24.167
At a glance. How many of the 9 automations are switched on, messages sent today and in the last 30 days, and how many are waiting to go.

00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:34.733
Run now. Runs the checks straight away instead of waiting for the next run: whatever is due gets queued and its call tickets made. A message says what it did.

00:00:35.233 --> 00:00:40.100
Wording. Opens the Wording tab: the words of every email and text.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:47.300
Today's clock. Each dot is a message sent today, at the hour it went. The red hand is now.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:56.400
Engine. Green when the automatic run is connected (every 10 minutes). Until then the checks run whenever the office opens the app.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:01.900
Last run. When the checks last ran. Amber if it was over an hour ago.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:08.467
Sending. When the last message went out. Amber if a message has waited more than 20 minutes.

00:01:08.967 --> 00:01:16.900
Live email. On: messages go to customers. Off: they go to the test address. Change it under Sending setup.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:21.533
Texts. Whether text messages are switched on (Sending setup).

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:29.500
Online estimates. Whether the online estimate links, where customers view and accept online, are installed.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.967
What runs. Every automation, with its switch and timing.

00:01:34.467 --> 00:01:46.333
One automation. What it does, its flow (what starts it, the wait, what goes out), its timing, how many went out in 30 days and Edit wording. Change a number and a Save button appears.

00:01:46.833 --> 00:01:56.267
On or off. The switch turns it on or off and saves straight away. The tour "Switch reminders and notices on or off" goes through all nine.

00:01:56.767 --> 00:01:59.500
Queue. Messages waiting to go.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:13.533
Waiting to go. Each message, customer, subject and address, and when it goes. The eye shows it, the arrow sends it now, the x cancels it. If its reason goes away (paid, answered) it cancels itself.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.000
Sent. What went out.

00:02:16.633 --> 00:02:28.467
What went out. The last 80 messages, newest first, with All / Sent / Not sent. The eye shows a message; the round arrow sends a failed, cancelled or skipped one again.

00:02:28.967 --> 00:02:31.933
Wording. The words of every message.

00:02:32.433 --> 00:02:44.867
The words. Pick a message under Every message, change its subject and text, and see it on the right as a customer gets it. The tour "Change the wording of an email or text" shows each part.

00:02:45.367 --> 00:02:50.000
Sending setup. The Sending setup tab: how messages are sent.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:03:02.733
How sending is set up. Live email, the test address, the address customers write to, texts, links in messages, crew photo rules and QuickBooks items. Save setup keeps them.

00:03:03.233 --> 00:03:06.900
Runs. The Runs tab: every run of the checks.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:18.200
Automation runs. When each run happened, what started it (the timer, the office or Run now), how long it took and what it did. A red tag means a part failed.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:28.700
Online estimate events. Online estimates opened, accepted and declined, as the platform reported them. Click one to open the estimate.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:34.800
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
